Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.10.85-rt93 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.10.85 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.10-rt
  Head SHA1: 1b459b86c30984dd381c92f8fe12257a30e9c79e


Or to build 3.10.85-rt93 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.10.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.10.85.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.10/patch-3.10.85-rt93.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
